### Log In and Remember This Device (returns session.token)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "test.staff@nextan.com.sg",
  "password": "<password>",
  "trustDevice": true,
  "portal": "staff"
}

### Resume a Remembered Sign-in (returns a new token; the old one stops working)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/auth/resume
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "token": "<session.token>"
}

### List My Remembered Devices
GET http://localhost:5000/api/v1/auth/sessions
Authorization: Bearer <session.token>

### Sign Out All My Other Devices
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/auth/sessions/revoke
Authorization: Bearer <session.token>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "allOthers": true
}

### Mark This Portal's First-Login Walkthrough as Seen (portal: staff | manager | account_manager | hr)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/auth/tours/complete
Authorization: Bearer <session.token>
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "portal": "staff"
}

### Log Out (ends this device's session)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/auth/logout
Authorization: Bearer <session.token>

### Undo a Leave Decision (manager, within 10 minutes; back to PENDING)
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/v1/leave/undo-review
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "leaveId": "<leave_id>",
  "reviewerId": "<manager user_id>"
}

### Pending Budget Requests for one manager (only projects they manage; HR sees all)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/v1/projects/budget-requests?reviewerId=<manager user_id>

### Budget Requests awaiting one Account Manager (only their projects; HR sees all)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/v1/projects/budget-requests/pending-am?reviewerId=<account manager user_id>

### My Inbox Feed (owner only: needs this user's session token)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/v1/users/<user_id>/inbox
Authorization: Bearer <session.token>

### Mark a Notification Read (owner only)
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/v1/notifications/<notification_id>/read
Authorization: Bearer <session.token>

### Undo a Budget Decision (manager, within 10 minutes; back to PENDING)
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/v1/projects/budget-request/undo-review
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "requestId": "<request_id>",
  "reviewerId": "<manager user_id>"
}

### Claims: scan a receipt photo (returns fields to check; nothing saved)
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/claims/scan
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <session.token>

{
  "receiptImage": "data:image/jpeg;base64,<base64>"
}

### Claims: submit
POST http://localhost:5000/api/v1/claims
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <session.token>

{
  "purchaseDate": "2026-10-04",
  "merchant": "Oracle Symphony (Tropicana) Sdn Bhd",
  "category": "MEALS",
  "currency": "MYR",
  "totalAmount": 70.8,
  "items": [{ "description": "Head charges (WK) A5", "quantity": 2, "amount": 60 }],
  "charges": [
    { "kind": "SERVICE_CHARGE", "label": "Service charge", "rate": 10, "amount": 6 },
    { "kind": "TAX", "label": "SST 8%", "rate": 8, "amount": 4.8 }
  ],
  "taxInclusive": false,
  "receiptImage": "data:image/jpeg;base64,<base64>",
  "scanId": "<scanId from the scan, optional>"
}

### Claims: exchange rate into SGD for a purchase date (ECB reference rate; weekends use the last business day)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/v1/claims/fx-rate?currency=MYR&date=2026-10-04
Authorization: Bearer <session.token>

### Claims: manager decision (reason required to reject)
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/v1/claims/<claim_id>/manager-review
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <session.token>

{
  "action": "APPROVED"
}

### Claims: HR marks approved claims paid
PATCH http://localhost:5000/api/v1/claims/mark-paid
Content-Type: application/json
Authorization: Bearer <session.token>

{
  "claimIds": ["<claim_id>"],
  "paidDate": "2026-10-31",
  "paidReference": "Oct payroll"
}

### Claims: this month's scan cost vs the cap (HR)
GET http://localhost:5000/api/v1/claims/scan-usage
Authorization: Bearer <session.token>

